	"system": {
		"description": "<p><strong>Ability Score Increases:</strong> +1 to each of any two ability scores.</p>\n<p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Choose any two skills.</p>\n<p><strong>Tool Proficiencies:</strong> Choose any one tool or vehicle proficiency.</p>\n<p><strong>Suggested Equipment (Cost 0 credits):</strong> Basic clothing.</p>\n<p><em><strong>Feature: Rapid Healing.</strong></em> Your genetic makeup allows you to heal slightly faster than most others. When you spend a hit die to recover hit points, you recover an extra hit point per die.</p>\n<p><em><strong>Adventures and Advancement.</strong></em> You were a clone of somebody–your template–and they may decide to seek you out, either to know you, or to destroy you. Alternatively, the facility which created you may seek to recover you.</p>\n<p><em><strong>Connection and Memento.</strong></em> Roll 1d10, choose, or make up your own.</p>\n<p>@Embed[Compendium.a5e.a5e-roll-tables.RollTable.8GSjfur1s9o8WMo3 caption=false cite=true rollable=true]</p>\n<p>@Embed[Compendium.a5e.a5e-roll-tables.RollTable.7NTVTy4VfsmdBuL6 caption=false cite=true rollable=true]</p>",
